03:47.950 --> 03:52.990
And SQL will not allow you to insert any duplicates about the categories.

03:52.990 --> 03:57.710
And of course, it makes no sense to have unique index on the categories, because of course we're going

03:57.710 --> 03:58.870
to get duplicates here.

03:58.870 --> 04:00.430
But maybe you say, you know what?

04:00.590 --> 04:02.110
My products are unique.

